    "title": "Canasta",
    "description": "Canasta has its origins in South America and has remained popular to this day. It is a game that is simple in its rules yet filled with challenges, making it a delightful combination of strategy, skill, and teamwork that provides entertainment and excitement for players.\r\n\r\n\r\nHow to Play:\r\n\r\nCanasta is played using two standard decks of cards (excluding Jokers), which makes a total of 108 cards. \r\nThe objective of the game is to score points by creating Canastas, which are combinations of at least 7 cards with the same rank. \r\nThe game is won by the team that reaches a score of 5000 points first.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhy Choose Us:\r\n\r\nConsider a 5000-point game too long? Don't worry! You can exit the game at any time, and we'll save your progress. Moreover, we offer alternative modes, including a 'one-round' option, allowing you to play at your own pace.\r\n\r\nOur AI performs exceptionally, allowing you to deeply experience the joy of cooperating with teammates and the excitement of challenging opponents. \r\n\r\nAdditionally, we offer a variety of card back designs and colorful backgrounds to meet your personalized preferences.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat are you waiting for? Download now and experience it. We believe you'll be captivated by this game in no time!",
